  "claim_status": "source_derived_unreviewed",
  "reported_status": "Source-derived arguments and inspected producer replay; new extensions separately identified as integration-derived. Source and internally derived claims remain unreviewed. External correctness, historical priority and physical validity are UNKNOWN. Exact/floating diagnostics, producer-code replay and same-team analytic criticism do not independently validate universal mathematics, novelty or scientific capability.",
  "scientific_scope_status": "Negative material continuation of conditional N774, with separately derived passive harmonic-work bounds and finite controlled-Markov endpoint certificates. The supplied packet acquires neither a K-beta control pair nor retained repair. New matching-law rare-yield construction is a kinetic first-hit falsifier, not a finite-hopping irreversible quantum capture theorem. A later P2 source update adds a finite typed-graph selective-locking jam result and a global-completion guard with finite-time unfinished mass. The result is graph-model evidence only; no molecular geometry, rates, retained repair, or physical yield is acquired, and the N777 gates remain open.",
